<walter. alex. 3.285>	Assunt obiecta clipeorum crate clientes.
<walter. alex. 3.286>	Plurimus hic fundit fundam iaculator et arcum,
<walter. alex. 3.287>	Plurima suppositis mortem ballista minatur.
